## CfP will open 4 November 2027

The Call for Proposals for sessions at the core conference (20 - 22 April) will open on 4 November 2026.

## Other Calls

 - Call for masterclasses, see [here](/masterclasses/)
 - Call for sprint projects, see [here](/sprints/)
 - Call for hackathons and other satellite events, see [here](/satellite-events/)